---
description: CLIP MASTER project rules (setup, verify, conventions)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root first: it has the install/verify commands and the code map.

- Install: `./install.sh --yes` (Windows: `.\install.ps1 -Yes`). Verify: `./install.sh --check`, `ruff check .`, `pytest -m "not slow"`.
- UI strings need keys in both `static/i18n/fr.json` and `static/i18n/en.json`.
- Validate URLs/times before any subprocess; no `shell=True`; pass `--` before URLs.
- No brand/campaign-specific code. No vendored third-party code (use `third_party/manifest.yml`).
- Task recipes: `skills/*/SKILL.md`.
